@startuml

Digital Watch State Diagram

state Idle
Idle --> ChangeTime
Idle --> Alarm

state ChangeTime
ChangeTime : IncreaseValue(hour)
ChangeTime : IncreaseValue(minutes)
ChangeTime --> Idle

state Alarm
Alarm : ToggleAlarm
Alarm : SetAlarmTime
Alarm : MatchCurrentTime
Alarm : TriggerAlarm
Alarm : StopAlarm
Alarm --> Idle

state Light
Light : TurnOn
Light : TurnOff
Light --> Idle

ChangeTime --> Alarm : SwitchToAlarm
ChangeTime --> Light : SwitchToLight
@enduml
